            "review_title": "Review at Pao Quan",
            "review_text": "Malcolm D\nSydney, Australia703 contributions\n1\nGreat decor, food and service\nSep 2023 • Couples\nWe went to the restaurant at Cat Linh; and loved the decor and atmosphere. The many lanterns and multiple levels make this a very interesting restaurant to dine at. \n\nService was excellent and very friendly, much appreciated since we do not speak Vietnamese.\n\nWe had the frogs with bamboo shoots and a salad, and some coconut wine. the food was delicious, and the we had a great evening.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 30, 2023\nPao Quán\nPAO would like to sincerely thank you for leaving your feedback. We are honored that you have had good experiences with the restaurant. We constantly improve and enhance the quality of food, space and service to always have the honor of welcoming and serving you many times in the future.\nRead more\nWritten October 19, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
